cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these votes, please cite both this dataset and the paper it was released with."
title: "32judges-votes: per-item votes from a fixed 32-judge LLM panel"
abstract: >-
  Per-item judgments from the same panel of 32 LLM judges across multiple corpora: 1,000 items
  from each of the three ChaosNLI sets (MNLI-matched, SNLI, alphaNLI) with a presentation-order
  arm, and a score-only release for a 1,000-item Civil Comments toxicity sample. Released with
  per-dataset manifests, per-file hashes, the pinned judge roster of each collection round, and
  offline analysis code that makes no model or API calls. Source corpora are not redistributed.
type: dataset
version: "2.2"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
